    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a strange company.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 8 days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Playtime:</strong> 30 minutes ~ 1.5 hours <br> <br> <br> <br> <br>  <strong><i>1.</i></strong><strong><i><u> Turn on the computer and begin monitoring through the screen.</u></i></strong> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/78e8bc1a76bb71473260b709a9eb410c.poster.avif?t=1750420669\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/78e8bc1a76bb71473260b709a9eb410c.webm?t=1750420669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/78e8bc1a76bb71473260b709a9eb410c.mp4?t=1750420669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> <br>  <br><strong><i>2.Nothing will happen on the first day.</i></strong><strong><i><u>  </u></i></strong> <br><i><u> </u></i> <br><strong><i><u>Observe your surroundings carefully and remember every detail.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/5a6f22214d6a3fd3a9f86d11b88e141d.poster.avif?t=1750420669\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/5a6f22214d6a3fd3a9f86d11b88e141d.webm?t=1750420669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/5a6f22214d6a3fd3a9f86d11b88e141d.mp4?t=1750420669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> <br><strong><i>3.</i></strong><strong><i><u>If you notice any changes, report them immediately.</u></i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/4445b24a591d076e86cb7abe31458f6d.poster.avif?t=1750420669\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/4445b24a591d076e86cb7abe31458f6d.webm?t=1750420669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/4445b24a591d076e86cb7abe31458f6d.mp4?t=1750420669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong> <br> <br>This game offers a unique take on anomaly detection.Do not move.  <br>Watch the CCTV. Observe the NPCs' behavior and track any unusual movement of objects. <br> <br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Developer:</strong> Fissure </p>",
