otice any changes, report them immediately.</u></i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/4445b24a591d076e86cb7abe31458f6d.poster.avif?t=1750420669\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/4445b24a591d076e86cb7abe31458f6d.webm?t=1750420669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535830/extras/4445b24a591d076e86cb7abe31458f6d.mp4?t=1750420669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong> <br> <br>This game offers a unique take on anomaly detection.Do not move.  <br>Watch the CCTV. Observe the NPCs' behavior and track any unusual movement of objects. <br> <br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Developer:</strong> Fissure </p>",
